# MASTER PROMPT: COMPLETE ADMIN PANEL AUDIT, END-TO-END FUNCTIONAL TESTING, BUG DETECTION & PRODUCTION-GRADE REPAIR

## ROLE & RESPONSIBILITY

Act as a Senior QA Automation Engineer, Full-Stack Software Architect, Backend Engineer, Database Engineer, Security Engineer, and Production Reliability Specialist.

You are assigned to perform a complete end-to-end functional audit, systematic testing, bug detection, and production-grade repair of the existing e-commerce Admin Panel.

This is NOT a request to redesign the Admin Panel or rebuild the application.

Your responsibility is to inspect, understand, test, verify, and repair every existing Admin Panel module individually.

The primary objective is to ensure that every administrative feature genuinely works across:

- Admin Panel Frontend
- Backend APIs
- Business Logic
- Database
- File and Image Storage
- Public Website Frontend
- Authentication and Authorization
- Related Application Modules

**Do not consider a feature functional just because its interface looks correct or a success notification appears. Verify the actual operation and its persistence.**

