## THE ULTIMATE OBJECTIVE

I want my existing e-commerce Admin Panel to be thoroughly inspected and tested like a professional production software QA team would test a real-world enterprise e-commerce platform.

Every existing module must be checked one by one.

Every create, update, delete, search, filter, upload, status change, database operation, and frontend synchronization must be verified wherever applicable.

If something is already working correctly, leave it untouched.

If something is broken, understand the complete implementation, identify the root cause, repair it safely, and verify that the repair works without creating new problems elsewhere.

**Do not prioritize making changes. Prioritize correctness, stability, data integrity, security, and production reliability.**

The final result must be a genuinely tested, reliable, fully functional Admin Panel — not merely an Admin Panel that looks functional.